    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Mm. Where everyone can see. Go on, I dare you."
    new "Mm. Donde todos pueden ver. Anda, te reto."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "A stepmother caught with her stepson's hand on her ass... the risk makes it ten times better."
    new "Una madrastra atrapada con la mano de su hijastro en el culo... el riesgo lo hace diez veces mejor."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Is anyone watching? Good. Let them see what your stepmother lets you do."
    new "¿Alguien está mirando? Bien. Que vean lo que tu madrastra te deja hacer."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Here? With all these people around? ...That's exactly what makes it exciting."
    new "¿Aquí? ¿Con toda esta gente alrededor? ...Eso es justo lo que lo hace excitante."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "What if I slipped them off right here, in front of everyone? Would you like that, [Player.Name]?"
    new "¿Y si me las quitara aquí mismo, frente a todos? ¿Te gustaría, [Player.Name]?"

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Mm... anyone could walk by right now and see where your hand is."
    new "Mm... cualquiera podría pasar ahora mismo y ver dónde está tu mano."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Out here, where anyone could see us? Don't stop."
    new "¿Aquí afuera, donde cualquiera podría vernos? No pares."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "The thought of someone catching us like this..."
    new "Solo de pensar que alguien nos atrape así..."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "If anyone catches your stepmother like this, there's no explaining it. Keep going."
    new "Si alguien atrapa a tu madrastra así, no hay forma de explicarlo. Sigue."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Oh... if anyone sees where your hand is right now..."
    new "Oh... si alguien ve dónde está tu mano ahora mismo..."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Right here in public? God. I'm your father's wife, and you're touching me there."
    new "¿Aquí mismo, en público? Dios. Soy la esposa de tu padre, y me estás tocando ahí."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Not here. Someone might see us, [Player.Name]."
    new "Aquí no. Alguien podría vernos, [Player.Name]."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "People are watching. Kiss your stepmother in public and they'll start asking questions."
    new "La gente está mirando. Besa a tu madrastra en público y van a empezar a hacer preguntas."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Let go. People will talk if they see me holding my stepson's hand like this."
    new "Suéltame. La gente va a hablar si me ve tomada de la mano de mi hijastro así."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Not out here. Somewhere private, if you must."
    new "Aquí afuera no. En un lugar privado, si de verdad tienes que hacerlo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Have you lost your mind? People can see us."
    new "¿Perdiste la cabeza? La gente puede vernos."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Someone heard that. Everyone heard that. God, [Player.Name]..."
    new "Alguien escuchó eso. Todos escucharon eso. Dios, [Player.Name]..."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Not here. What if someone walks by? What if someone who knows your father walks by?"
    new "Aquí no. ¿Y si alguien pasa? ¿Y si pasa alguien que conoce a tu padre?"

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Are you trying to get us caught? Hands off. Now."
    new "¿Estás tratando de que nos atrapen? Quita las manos. Ya."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Someone could see. Are you out of your mind?"
    new "Alguien podría ver. ¿Estás loco?"

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Hand off my leg. We're in public, and I'm your stepmother."
    new "Quita la mano de mi pierna. Estamos en público, y soy tu madrastra."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Not here. People are watching us."
    new "Aquí no. La gente nos está mirando."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Stop. Right now. Do you want the whole place to see that?"
    new "Basta. Ahora mismo. ¿Quieres que todo el lugar vea eso?"

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Are you out of your mind? We're in public."
    new "¿Te volviste loco? Estamos en público."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Here? In front of all these people? Take your hand away before someone sees."
    new "¿Aquí? ¿Frente a toda esta gente? Quita la mano antes de que alguien vea."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Don't you have a girlfriend? Go touch her face, not your stepmother's."
    new "¿No tienes novia? Ve a tocarle la cara a ella, no a tu madrastra."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "You're taken, [Player.Name], and I'm married to your father. Hand down."
    new "Tienes pareja, [Player.Name], y yo estoy casada con tu padre. Baja la mano."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Does your girlfriend know you touch your stepmother like this?"
    new "¿Tu novia sabe que tocas así a tu madrastra?"

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "If she saw you right now, she'd never look at you the same way. Or at me."
    new "Si te viera ahora mismo, nunca volvería a mirarte igual. Ni a mí."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Have you lost your mind? You have a girlfriend."
    new "¿Perdiste la cabeza? Tienes novia."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Not while you're with someone. A girlfriend and a stepmother is one secret too many."
    new "No mientras estés con alguien. Una novia y una madrastra es un secreto de más."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Your girlfriend would hate this. Your father would hate it more. And I don't care."
    new "Tu novia odiaría esto. Tu padre lo odiaría más. Y a mí no me importa."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "I hope she never finds out. Then again... that's your problem, not mine."
    new "Espero que nunca se entere. Aunque pensándolo bien... ese es tu problema, no el mío."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Does your girlfriend let you do that? I doubt it."
    new "¿Tu novia te deja hacer eso? Lo dudo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Careful. Your girlfriend might get jealous of your stepmother."
    new "Cuidado. Tu novia podría ponerse celosa de tu madrastra."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "I bet your girlfriend doesn't let you grab hers like this."
    new "Apuesto a que tu novia no te deja agarrarle los pechos así."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_flirt_lines.rpy:34
    old "Wash your hands before you touch her again. She'd smell my perfume on you."
    new "Lávate las manos antes de volver a tocarla. Olería mi perfume en ti."

